{"title":"After the High School Goddess Dumped Me, I Became a Martial Arts God","synopsis":"Fang Yi bertransmigrasi ke dunia baru, lalu dicampakkan oleh pacarnya yang cantik di sekolah tepat setelah tiba. Ia pikir itu hanyalah awal dari kisah romansa urban yang klise…\nHingga sistem memperingatkannya: “Energi spiritual akan bangkit dalam satu tahun. Dunia akan menghadapi pergolakan besar. Kiamat akan datang.”\n\n“Dengan sistem dan monzeekomik di sisi ku, mengapa aku harus takut pada apa pun?”","alternative_title":"被校花分手后，我直接武道通神","author":"WenYuan Culture (闻源文化)","artist":"WenYuan Culture (闻源文化)","genres":["Action","Adventure","Fantasy","Thriller"],"chapters":[{"id":"c2fa5c1f-2212-42bc-a00c-d56e22d210a3","number":"101","title":"Chapter 101","date":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"id":"46204bf6-424d-466a-b51b-32fbfb78560f","number":"100","title":"Chapter 100","date":"2026-07-29","images":[]},{"id":"3bfa1d30-58a3-4ae7-9787-b716612808dd","number":"99","title":"Chapter 99","date":"2026-07-28","images":[]},{"id":"4baaf832-3529-4c9f-bfb5-f61bbecb6f6f","number":"98","title":"Chapter 98","date":"2026-07-26","images":[]},{"id":"5b0920e4-6de9-4300-8e10-4879e0de5e4b","number":"97","title":"Chapter 97","date":"2026-07-24","images":[]},{"id":"23587eff-1a13-4f2d-be48-0856e320a10e","number":"96","title":"Chapter 96","date":"2026-07-23","images":[]},{"id":"22457b70-38ee-4072-ac8f-5a3fa311a510","number":"95","title":"Chapter 95","date":"2026-07-22","images":[]},{"id":"262e0df4-a559-497d-b3f8-4c7a96ecd0a4","number":"94","title":"Chapter 94","date":"2026-07-21","images":[]},{"id":"8225beed-e136-4a34-947e-116f9df2048a","number":"93","title":"Chapter 93","date":"2026-07-15","images":[]},{"id":"7471f152-e67b-4337-92dd-5b1a089103b0","number":"92","title":"Chapter 92","date":"2026-07-10","images":[]},{"id":"8640addd-ebe0-4dab-be77-f3966bceb17b","number":"91","title":"Chapter 91","date":"2026-07-03","images":[]},{"id":"7aa5b3b3-b9c2-48d1-989f-c5324e7f6237","number":"90","title":"Chapter 90","dat